{"version":1,"title":"Mindprint","author":"Northpeak Studios","count":77,"likert_labels":["Not me at all","Not really","Sort of","Mostly","Totally me"],"questions":[{"id":"x3","type":"choice","text":"A new kid is sitting alone at lunch. You…","options":[{"t":"Go sit with them","s":{"A_empathy":2,"E_sociability":1}},{"t":"Wave them over to my table","s":{"A_empathy":1,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Feel bad, but don't do anything","s":{"A_empathy":1,"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Honestly, I probably wouldn't notice","s":{"A_empathy":-1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":1},{"id":"n1","type":"likert","text":"I overthink things I said or did, sometimes days later.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_anxiety":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_anxiety":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_anxiety":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":2},{"id":"so4","type":"choice","text":"After a long day around people, you feel…","options":[{"t":"Hyped. I want more!","s":{"E_sociability":2}},{"t":"Fine. It could go either way.","s":{}},{"t":"Drained. I need to be alone.","s":{"E_sociability":-2}}],"framework":"Social energy","n":3},{"id":"c6","type":"likert","text":"Doing the bare minimum is honestly fine with me.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_achievement":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_achievement":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_achievement":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_achievement":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":4},{"id":"cf3","type":"choice","text":"Someone in class says something you strongly disagree with. You…","options":[{"t":"Debate them until it's settled","s":{"cf_competing":2,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Ask why they think that and look for common ground","s":{"cf_collaborating":2,"O_ideas":1}},{"t":"Say my view once, then let it go","s":{"cf_compromising":2}},{"t":"Probably end up seeing their side","s":{"cf_accommodating":2}},{"t":"Keep it to myself","s":{"cf_avoiding":2,"E_assertiveness":-1}}],"framework":"Conflict style (Thomas-Kilmann)","n":5},{"id":"e2","type":"likert","text":"After hanging out for a while, I need alone time to recharge.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_sociability":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_sociability":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_sociability":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_sociability":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":6},{"id":"s1","type":"choice","text":"You have a big test tomorrow, and you feel unprepared. You…","options":[{"t":"Make a plan and grind through it","s":{"cope_tackle":2,"C_discipline":1}},{"t":"Text a friend to study together or vent","s":{"cope_support":2}},{"t":"Play games or scroll so I don't have to think about it","s":{"cope_distract":2,"C_discipline":-1}},{"t":"Tell myself it's one test and do what I can","s":{"cope_reframe":2,"N_anxiety":-1}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":7},{"id":"c5","type":"likert","text":"I push myself to be really good at the things I care about.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_achievement":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_achievement":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_achievement":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_achievement":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":8},{"id":"so1","type":"choice","text":"It's Friday night and you have no plans. What sounds ideal?","options":[{"t":"A big party or a big group hangout","s":{"E_sociability":2,"E_excitement":1}},{"t":"A few close friends","s":{"E_sociability":1}},{"t":"One person I'm really close with","s":{}},{"t":"Home alone with my own stuff","s":{"E_sociability":-2}}],"framework":"Social energy","n":9},{"id":"e1","type":"likert","text":"Being around a lot of people gives me energy.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_sociability":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_sociability":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_sociability":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_sociability":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":10},{"id":"so2","type":"choice","text":"You walk into a room full of people you don't know. You…","options":[{"t":"Start talking to people","s":{"E_sociability":2,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Find one person and stick with them","s":{}},{"t":"Wait for someone to talk to me","s":{"E_sociability":-1,"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Find a corner and my phone","s":{"E_sociability":-2,"N_selfcon":1}}],"framework":"Social energy","n":11},{"id":"o6","type":"likert","text":"I like my routines and don't feel a need to switch things up.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_adventure":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_adventure":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_adventure":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_adventure":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":12},{"id":"cf5","type":"choice","text":"A sibling (or someone you live with) keeps taking your stuff. You…","options":[{"t":"Set a rule and enforce it","s":{"cf_competing":2}},{"t":"Sit down and make a deal that works for both of us","s":{"cf_collaborating":2}},{"t":"Let them borrow some things but not others","s":{"cf_compromising":2}},{"t":"Let it slide. It's not worth the fight.","s":{"cf_accommodating":2}},{"t":"Hide my stuff so it never comes up","s":{"cf_avoiding":2}}],"framework":"Conflict style (Thomas-Kilmann)","n":13},{"id":"a4","type":"likert","text":"Other people's drama doesn't really affect me.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_empathy":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_empathy":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_empathy":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_empathy":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":14},{"id":"s7","type":"choice","text":"When you get criticized (a harsh grade comment, a coach yelling), you…","options":[{"t":"Use it to get better","s":{"cope_tackle":1,"cope_reframe":1,"C_achievement":1}},{"t":"Feel it sting and think about it a lot","s":{"N_selfcon":1,"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Get defensive","s":{"cope_express":1,"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Brush it off","s":{"cope_distract":1,"N_anxiety":-1}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":15},{"id":"n6","type":"likert","text":"I don't really care what people think of me.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_selfcon":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_selfcon":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_selfcon":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":16},{"id":"v2","type":"choice","text":"Which compliment would hit hardest?","options":[{"t":"\"You're so original.\"","s":{"v_self_direction":2}},{"t":"\"You're the most fun to be around.\"","s":{"v_hedonism":2}},{"t":"\"You're crazy talented.\"","s":{"v_achievement":2}},{"t":"\"You're such a good person.\"","s":{"v_benevolence":2}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":17},{"id":"o3","type":"likert","text":"I go down rabbit holes learning random stuff just because it's interesting.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_ideas":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_ideas":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_ideas":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_ideas":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":18},{"id":"s3","type":"choice","text":"When you're really stressed, people would notice that you…","options":[{"t":"Get quiet and pull away","s":{"cope_withdraw":2}},{"t":"Get snappy or irritable","s":{"cope_express":2,"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Get extra busy and productive","s":{"cope_tackle":2}},{"t":"Act like everything's totally fine","s":{"cope_distract":1,"att_avoidance":1}},{"t":"Want to be around people more","s":{"cope_support":2}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":19},{"id":"a5","type":"likert","text":"I'll go along with what the group wants to keep the peace.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_cooperation":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_cooperation":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_cooperation":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_cooperation":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":20},{"id":"x4","type":"choice","text":"The group chat is full of an inside joke you don't get. You…","options":[{"t":"Just ask what it is","s":{"N_selfcon":-1,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Feel a little left out","s":{"att_anxiety":1,"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Laugh along anyway","s":{"A_cooperation":1,"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"I don't care. I scroll past.","s":{"att_avoidance":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":21},{"id":"at6","type":"likert","text":"It's easy for me to open up to people I trust.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_avoidance":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_avoidance":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_avoidance":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_avoidance":-2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":22},{"id":"x2","type":"choice","text":"You find out a friend has been talking behind your back. You…","options":[{"t":"Confront them directly","s":{"E_assertiveness":2,"cf_competing":1}},{"t":"Quietly drift away from them","s":{"att_avoidance":2,"cf_avoiding":1}},{"t":"Feel crushed and wonder what's wrong with me","s":{"att_anxiety":2,"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Calmly ask them about it to hear their side","s":{"cf_collaborating":2,"A_trust":1}},{"t":"Talk it over with my other friends","s":{"cope_support":1,"cope_express":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":23},{"id":"o5","type":"likert","text":"I like trying foods, music, or places I've never tried before.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_adventure":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_adventure":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_adventure":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_adventure":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":24},{"id":"d1","type":"choice","text":"Picking a game, show, or thing to buy, you…","options":[{"t":"Read reviews and compare a bunch of options","s":{"dm_rational":2,"dm_maximizer":1}},{"t":"Go with what feels right","s":{"dm_intuitive":2}},{"t":"Grab the first one that seems decent","s":{"dm_spontaneous":1,"dm_maximizer":-2}},{"t":"Ask what my friends think","s":{"dm_dependent":2}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":25},{"id":"n3","type":"likert","text":"Small things annoy me more than they probably should.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_anger":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_anger":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_anger":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":26},{"id":"x9","type":"choice","text":"You're told you can't do something, with no reason given. You…","options":[{"t":"Do it anyway","s":{"v_self_direction":1,"v_conformity":-1,"dm_risk":1}},{"t":"Ask why until I get a real answer","s":{"O_ideas":1,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Accept it. There's probably a reason.","s":{"v_conformity":2,"A_trust":1}},{"t":"Grumble about it, but listen","s":{"N_anger":1,"v_conformity":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":27},{"id":"c4","type":"likert","text":"I put things off until the last possible minute.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_discipline":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_discipline":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_discipline":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_discipline":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":28},{"id":"d2","type":"choice","text":"You have a big decision to make (which class, team, or club). You…","options":[{"t":"Make a pros and cons list","s":{"dm_rational":2}},{"t":"Trust my gut","s":{"dm_intuitive":2}},{"t":"Ask people I trust","s":{"dm_dependent":2}},{"t":"Put it off as long as I can","s":{"dm_avoidant":2,"N_anxiety":1}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":29},{"id":"o1","type":"likert","text":"I zone out into daydreams and imaginary scenarios a lot.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_fantasy":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_fantasy":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_fantasy":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_fantasy":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":30},{"id":"d7","type":"choice","text":"You're stuck between two choices that both seem fine. You…","options":[{"t":"Flip a coin and go","s":{"dm_spontaneous":2,"dm_maximizer":-1}},{"t":"Notice which one I secretly hoped the coin would land on","s":{"dm_intuitive":2}},{"t":"Keep researching until one clearly wins","s":{"dm_rational":1,"dm_maximizer":2}},{"t":"Wait and let it sort itself out","s":{"dm_avoidant":2}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":31},{"id":"e3","type":"likert","text":"In a group, I usually end up being the one who takes charge.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_assertiveness":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_assertiveness":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_assertiveness":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":32},{"id":"v5","type":"choice","text":"In a friend group, you'd most want to be…","options":[{"t":"The one who makes the calls","s":{"v_power":2,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"The one with the creative ideas","s":{"v_self_direction":2,"O_fantasy":1}},{"t":"The one who keeps everyone happy","s":{"v_benevolence":2}},{"t":"The reliable one everyone counts on","s":{"v_conformity":1,"v_security":1,"C_discipline":1}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":33},{"id":"a3","type":"likert","text":"When a friend is upset, I feel it too.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_empathy":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_empathy":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_empathy":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_empathy":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":34},{"id":"v4","type":"choice","text":"Which of these would bother you the most?","options":[{"t":"Being told exactly how to do everything","s":{"v_self_direction":2}},{"t":"Seeing someone get treated unfairly","s":{"v_universalism":2}},{"t":"Being bored with nothing going on","s":{"v_stimulation":2}},{"t":"Not being taken seriously","s":{"v_power":2}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":35},{"id":"o4","type":"likert","text":"Deep \"what's the point of it all\" questions bore me.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_ideas":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_ideas":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_ideas":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_ideas":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":36},{"id":"s5","type":"choice","text":"A plan you were really excited about gets ruined. You…","options":[{"t":"Immediately start working on plan B","s":{"cope_tackle":2}},{"t":"Feel bummed for a while, then move on","s":{"cope_express":1,"cope_reframe":1}},{"t":"Get really frustrated","s":{"cope_express":2,"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Shrug it off. There will be other chances.","s":{"cope_reframe":2,"N_anxiety":-1}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":37},{"id":"n5","type":"likert","text":"I feel awkward when people are watching me do something.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_selfcon":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_selfcon":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_selfcon":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_selfcon":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":38},{"id":"x8","type":"choice","text":"Someone you just met wants to become close friends, fast. You…","options":[{"t":"Love it. Let's go!","s":{"A_trust":1,"E_sociability":1}},{"t":"Cool, but I take a while to really open up","s":{"att_avoidance":1}},{"t":"It feels weird. I'd back off.","s":{"att_avoidance":2,"A_trust":-1}},{"t":"Love it, but I'd worry they'll get bored of me","s":{"att_anxiety":2}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":39},{"id":"e5","type":"likert","text":"I'm drawn to things that are loud, fast, or a little intense.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_excitement":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_excitement":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_excitement":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_excitement":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":40},{"id":"x1","type":"choice","text":"Your friend cancels plans last minute. You…","options":[{"t":"Feel relieved. Chill night for me.","s":{"E_sociability":-2}},{"t":"Wonder if they're mad at me","s":{"att_anxiety":2}},{"t":"Feel annoyed, but say “All good.”","s":{"cf_accommodating":1,"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Text someone else and make new plans","s":{"E_sociability":2,"cope_tackle":1}},{"t":"Tell them it's annoying when they do that","s":{"E_assertiveness":1,"cf_competing":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":41},{"id":"at1","type":"likert","text":"I sometimes worry my friends like each other more than they like me.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_anxiety":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_anxiety":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_anxiety":2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":42},{"id":"x7","type":"choice","text":"A friend asks your honest opinion on something they made, and it's not great. You…","options":[{"t":"Tell them straight. They asked.","s":{"E_assertiveness":1,"A_cooperation":-1}},{"t":"Point out the good parts and gently suggest fixes","s":{"A_empathy":1,"cf_collaborating":1}},{"t":"Say it's great","s":{"A_cooperation":1,"cf_accommodating":1}},{"t":"Change the subject","s":{"cf_avoiding":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":43},{"id":"c2","type":"likert","text":"I lose track of my stuff (charger, keys, homework) pretty often.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_order":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_order":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_order":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_order":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":44},{"id":"s6","type":"choice","text":"You have way too much to do. You…","options":[{"t":"Make a list and knock things out one by one","s":{"cope_tackle":2,"C_order":1}},{"t":"Freeze up and do nothing for a while","s":{"cope_withdraw":2,"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Ask for help or an extension","s":{"cope_support":2}},{"t":"Do the fun or easy stuff first","s":{"cope_distract":2}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":45},{"id":"at5","type":"likert","text":"When someone gets really close to me, part of me wants to back off.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_avoidance":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_avoidance":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_avoidance":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_avoidance":2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":46},{"id":"d4","type":"choice","text":"Would you rather have…","options":[{"t":"$50, guaranteed","s":{"dm_risk":-2}},{"t":"A 50/50 shot at $150","s":{"dm_risk":2}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":47},{"id":"a2","type":"likert","text":"I get suspicious when people are nice to me for no reason.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_trust":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_trust":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_trust":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_trust":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":48},{"id":"d3","type":"choice","text":"After you choose something, you…","options":[{"t":"Keep wondering if the other option was better","s":{"dm_maximizer":2,"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Sometimes wonder, but I'm mostly fine","s":{}},{"t":"Commit and don't look back","s":{"dm_maximizer":-2}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":49},{"id":"at3","type":"likert","text":"I need people to show they care, or I start to doubt it.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_anxiety":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_anxiety":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_anxiety":2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":50},{"id":"s4","type":"choice","text":"What helps most after a bad day?","options":[{"t":"Music, games, or a show","s":{"cope_distract":2}},{"t":"Talking to someone","s":{"cope_support":2}},{"t":"Being alone for a bit","s":{"cope_withdraw":2}},{"t":"Doing something active (sports, walk, gym)","s":{"cope_reframe":1,"cope_distract":1}},{"t":"Writing, drawing, or making something about it","s":{"cope_express":2,"O_fantasy":1}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":51},{"id":"n2","type":"likert","text":"I don't worry much. Things usually work out.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_anxiety":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_anxiety":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_anxiety":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":52},{"id":"v1","type":"choice","text":"Pick the life that sounds best at 30:","options":[{"t":"Doing my own thing, my own way, no boss","s":{"v_self_direction":2}},{"t":"Always traveling, always something new","s":{"v_stimulation":2}},{"t":"Respected and at the top of my field","s":{"v_achievement":2}},{"t":"Stable and comfy, with people I love close by","s":{"v_security":1,"v_benevolence":1}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":53},{"id":"at2","type":"likert","text":"If someone takes forever to text back, I wonder if I did something wrong.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_anxiety":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_anxiety":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_anxiety":2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":54},{"id":"v3","type":"choice","text":"You win $10,000. First move?","options":[{"t":"Save or invest most of it","s":{"v_security":2}},{"t":"An epic trip or experience","s":{"v_stimulation":2}},{"t":"Buy the stuff I've wanted forever","s":{"v_hedonism":2}},{"t":"Give a real chunk to family or a cause","s":{"v_benevolence":1,"v_universalism":1}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":55},{"id":"o2","type":"likert","text":"I'd rather deal with what's real than imagine what could be.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"O_fantasy":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"O_fantasy":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"O_fantasy":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"O_fantasy":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":56},{"id":"cf4","type":"choice","text":"A friend is mad at you, and you think they're the one who's wrong. You…","options":[{"t":"Explain exactly why I'm right","s":{"cf_competing":2}},{"t":"Hear them out fully, then explain my side and work it out","s":{"cf_collaborating":2}},{"t":"Meet them halfway. We were both a little wrong.","s":{"cf_compromising":2}},{"t":"Apologize so it's over","s":{"cf_accommodating":2,"att_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Give it space and wait for it to blow over","s":{"cf_avoiding":2,"att_avoidance":1}}],"framework":"Conflict style (Thomas-Kilmann)","n":57},{"id":"at4","type":"likert","text":"I'd rather handle things myself than depend on other people.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"att_avoidance":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"att_avoidance":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"att_avoidance":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"att_avoidance":2}}],"framework":"Attachment","n":58},{"id":"v6","type":"choice","text":"Pick a superpower:","options":[{"t":"Flying: go anywhere, anytime","s":{"v_stimulation":1,"v_self_direction":1}},{"t":"Persuading anyone of anything","s":{"v_power":2}},{"t":"Healing people","s":{"v_benevolence":2}},{"t":"Seeing the future","s":{"v_security":2}},{"t":"Genius-level brain","s":{"v_achievement":2,"O_ideas":1}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":59},{"id":"c1","type":"likert","text":"My room, files, or notes have some kind of system.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_order":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_order":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_order":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_order":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":60},{"id":"so5","type":"choice","text":"When you're figuring out what you think about something, you…","options":[{"t":"Talk it out with someone","s":{"E_sociability":1,"dm_dependent":1}},{"t":"Think it through on my own first","s":{"E_sociability":-1,"dm_rational":1}}],"framework":"Social energy","n":61},{"id":"a6","type":"likert","text":"I'll argue a point just to win, even when it doesn't really matter.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_cooperation":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_cooperation":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_cooperation":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_cooperation":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":62},{"id":"d5","type":"choice","text":"How fast do you usually decide stuff?","options":[{"t":"Instantly. I go with the impulse.","s":{"dm_spontaneous":2}},{"t":"Pretty fast, once I've thought for a second","s":{"dm_rational":1,"dm_intuitive":1}},{"t":"Slow. I need all the info first.","s":{"dm_rational":1,"dm_maximizer":1}},{"t":"It depends on what everyone else is doing","s":{"dm_dependent":2}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":63},{"id":"c3","type":"likert","text":"When I say I'll do something, I actually do it.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"C_discipline":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"C_discipline":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"C_discipline":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"C_discipline":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":64},{"id":"x6","type":"choice","text":"A teacher makes a mistake on your grade, in your favor. You…","options":[{"t":"Tell them","s":{"v_conformity":1,"v_universalism":1,"A_cooperation":1}},{"t":"It depends how big the mistake is","s":{}},{"t":"Keep quiet. Their mistake, not mine.","s":{"A_cooperation":-1,"v_hedonism":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":65},{"id":"n4","type":"likert","text":"It takes a lot to make me mad.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"N_anger":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"N_anger":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"N_anger":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"N_anger":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":66},{"id":"so3","type":"choice","text":"In the group chat, you're…","options":[{"t":"Always sending stuff","s":{"E_sociability":2}},{"t":"Reacting, but not saying much","s":{}},{"t":"Only active when it's something I care about","s":{"E_sociability":-1}},{"t":"On mute, honestly","s":{"E_sociability":-2}}],"framework":"Social energy","n":67},{"id":"e4","type":"likert","text":"I'd rather let someone else do the talking.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_assertiveness":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_assertiveness":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_assertiveness":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":68},{"id":"d6","type":"choice","text":"Someone dares you to do something scary but safe (a giant rollercoaster, singing on stage). You…","options":[{"t":"I'm already doing it","s":{"dm_risk":2,"E_excitement":2}},{"t":"Do it after some hyping up","s":{"dm_risk":1,"E_excitement":1}},{"t":"I probably wouldn't","s":{"dm_risk":-1}},{"t":"Absolutely not","s":{"dm_risk":-2,"N_anxiety":1}}],"framework":"Decision-making (GDMS-style)","n":69},{"id":"e6","type":"likert","text":"I'd pick a calm night over a wild one.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"E_excitement":2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"E_excitement":1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"E_excitement":-1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"E_excitement":-2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":70},{"id":"cf2","type":"choice","text":"In a group project, someone isn't doing their part. You…","options":[{"t":"Call them out directly","s":{"cf_competing":2,"E_assertiveness":1}},{"t":"Talk to them privately, figure out what's up, and fix it together","s":{"cf_collaborating":2,"A_empathy":1}},{"t":"Suggest re-splitting the work so it's fair","s":{"cf_compromising":2}},{"t":"Do their part myself so it gets done","s":{"cf_accommodating":2,"C_achievement":1}},{"t":"Say nothing and hope it works out","s":{"cf_avoiding":2}}],"framework":"Conflict style (Thomas-Kilmann)","n":71},{"id":"a1","type":"likert","text":"I assume people mean well until they show me otherwise.","options":[{"t":"Not me at all","s":{"A_trust":-2}},{"t":"Not really","s":{"A_trust":-1}},{"t":"Sort of","s":{}},{"t":"Mostly","s":{"A_trust":1}},{"t":"Totally me","s":{"A_trust":2}}],"framework":"Big Five (OCEAN)","n":72},{"id":"x5","type":"choice","text":"You get a free day with zero obligations. You…","options":[{"t":"Learn or build something new","s":{"O_ideas":2,"v_achievement":1}},{"t":"Go on an adventure somewhere","s":{"O_adventure":2,"v_stimulation":1}},{"t":"Hang out with friends all day","s":{"E_sociability":2,"v_hedonism":1}},{"t":"Sleep, games, snacks, full recharge","s":{"v_hedonism":2,"E_sociability":-1}},{"t":"Get ahead on stuff I need to do","s":{"C_achievement":2,"C_discipline":1}}],"framework":"Scenarios (mixed)","n":73},{"id":"s2","type":"choice","text":"Something embarrassing happens in front of everyone. You…","options":[{"t":"Laugh it off right away","s":{"cope_reframe":2,"N_selfcon":-1}},{"t":"Replay it in my head for days","s":{"N_selfcon":2,"N_anxiety":1}},{"t":"Tell my friends about it so it's less weird","s":{"cope_support":2}},{"t":"Avoid those people for a while","s":{"cope_withdraw":2,"N_selfcon":1}}],"framework":"Stress & coping","n":74},{"id":"cf1","type":"choice","text":"You and a friend want to do completely different things on Saturday. You…","options":[{"t":"Push for my plan. It's the better one.","s":{"cf_competing":2}},{"t":"Find something we're both actually excited about","s":{"cf_collaborating":2}},{"t":"Split it: half the day mine, half theirs","s":{"cf_compromising":2}},{"t":"Just go with their plan. It's not a big deal.","s":{"cf_accommodating":2}},{"t":"Sort of dodge it and see if the plans fall through","s":{"cf_avoiding":2}}],"framework":"Conflict style (Thomas-Kilmann)","n":75},{"id":"v7","type":"choice","text":"Rules are…","options":[{"t":"Important. They keep things working.","s":{"v_conformity":2}},{"t":"Guidelines. I follow the good ones and question the dumb ones.","s":{"v_self_direction":2}},{"t":"Honestly, kind of made to be broken","s":{"v_stimulation":1,"v_conformity":-1}},{"t":"Only fair if they apply to everyone equally","s":{"v_universalism":2}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":76},{"id":"v8","type":"choice","text":"What would you most want to be known for?","options":[{"t":"Making something amazing","s":{"v_achievement":2}},{"t":"Making the world better","s":{"v_universalism":2}},{"t":"Always being there for my people","s":{"v_benevolence":2}},{"t":"Living an unforgettable life","s":{"v_hedonism":1,"v_stimulation":1}},{"t":"Being influential","s":{"v_power":2}}],"framework":"Values (Schwartz)","n":77}],"scales":{"O":{"framework":"Big Five","name":"Openness","desc":"Imagination, curiosity, love of new experiences"},"C":{"framework":"Big Five","name":"Conscientiousness","desc":"Organization, follow-through, drive"},"E":{"framework":"Big Five","name":"Extraversion","desc":"Social energy, assertiveness, thrill-seeking"},"A":{"framework":"Big Five","name":"Agreeableness","desc":"Trust, empathy, cooperation"},"N":{"framework":"Big Five","name":"Emotional sensitivity","desc":"How strongly stress, worry and frustration hit"},"O_fantasy":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Imagination","desc":""},"O_ideas":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Intellectual curiosity","desc":""},"O_adventure":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Adventurousness","desc":""},"C_order":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Orderliness","desc":""},"C_discipline":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Self-discipline","desc":""},"C_achievement":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Achievement drive","desc":""},"E_sociability":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Sociability / social battery","desc":""},"E_assertiveness":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Assertiveness","desc":""},"E_excitement":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Excitement-seeking","desc":""},"A_trust":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Trust","desc":""},"A_empathy":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Empathy","desc":""},"A_cooperation":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Cooperation / harmony-seeking","desc":""},"N_anxiety":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Worry / overthinking","desc":""},"N_anger":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Irritability","desc":""},"N_selfcon":{"framework":"Big Five facet","name":"Self-consciousness","desc":""},"att_anxiety":{"framework":"Attachment","name":"Attachment anxiety","desc":"Fear of being left out, needing reassurance"},"att_avoidance":{"framework":"Attachment","name":"Attachment avoidance","desc":"Discomfort with closeness and depending on others"},"cf_competing":{"framework":"Conflict style","name":"Competing","desc":"Assert your side, aim to win"},"cf_collaborating":{"framework":"Conflict style","name":"Collaborating","desc":"Work it out so both sides win"},"cf_compromising":{"framework":"Conflict style","name":"Compromising","desc":"Meet in the middle"},"cf_accommodating":{"framework":"Conflict style","name":"Accommodating","desc":"Give way to keep the peace"},"cf_avoiding":{"framework":"Conflict style","name":"Avoiding","desc":"Step back, let it pass"},"v_self_direction":{"framework":"Values","name":"Self-direction","desc":"Freedom, originality, doing it your way"},"v_stimulation":{"framework":"Values","name":"Stimulation","desc":"Novelty, excitement, adventure"},"v_hedonism":{"framework":"Values","name":"Enjoyment","desc":"Fun, pleasure, enjoying life"},"v_achievement":{"framework":"Values","name":"Achievement","desc":"Being great at things, recognition for skill"},"v_power":{"framework":"Values","name":"Influence","desc":"Status, control, being taken seriously"},"v_security":{"framework":"Values","name":"Security","desc":"Stability, safety, planning ahead"},"v_conformity":{"framework":"Values","name":"Conformity/tradition","desc":"Rules, reliability, fitting expectations"},"v_benevolence":{"framework":"Values","name":"Benevolence","desc":"Caring for the people close to you"},"v_universalism":{"framework":"Values","name":"Universalism","desc":"Fairness, justice, the wider world"},"cope_tackle":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Tackle it","desc":"Problem-focused: plan and act"},"cope_support":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Reach out","desc":"Seek support from people"},"cope_distract":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Distract","desc":"Shift attention away (games, shows, staying busy)"},"cope_reframe":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Reframe","desc":"See it differently, keep perspective"},"cope_withdraw":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Withdraw","desc":"Pull back, go quiet, freeze"},"cope_express":{"framework":"Coping","name":"Express","desc":"Let the feeling out (venting, making things, snapping)"},"dm_rational":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Rational","desc":"Research, compare, reason it out"},"dm_intuitive":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Intuitive","desc":"Gut feeling"},"dm_dependent":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Dependent/social","desc":"Lean on others' input"},"dm_avoidant":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Avoidant","desc":"Delay deciding"},"dm_spontaneous":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Spontaneous","desc":"Decide instantly on impulse"},"dm_maximizer":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Maximizer","desc":"Needs the best option; second-guesses"},"dm_risk":{"framework":"Decision-making","name":"Risk appetite","desc":"Comfort with gambles and uncertainty"}}}